---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-foot">
  <div class="shell inner">
    <div class="deco" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="cols">
      <section>
        <h2 class="label">What this is</h2>
        <p>
          A Fibonacci-radix streaming state machine: <strong>~30 ns per input bit</strong>,
          <strong>zero heap allocations</strong>, and a <strong>96-byte state</strong> that does not
          grow with stream length.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="label">What it is not</h2>
        <p>
          Not a tokenizer replacement. Not a transformer replacement. Not faster than anything in
          particular — it is a different primitive, measured honestly.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="label">Every number is computed</h2>
        <p>
          Nothing on this site is a recorded screenshot or a hard-coded fixture. The interactive
          demos call this repository's own Go, compiled to WebAssembly, so the figures are the same
          ones <code>make ci</code> asserts on.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="base">
      <p>
        <span class="num">Go {Astro.locals?.goVersion ?? '1.25'}</span> ·
        <span class="num">MIT</span> ·
        <a href="https://github.com/shaoyanji/fibtransponder">shaoyanji/fibtransponder</a>
      </p>
      <p class="muted">
        {year} · Built as an argument about reproducible measurement, not a product.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-foot {
    border-top: var(--rule-w) solid var(--rule);
    background: var(--surface);
    margin-top: 4rem;
    padding-block: 2.5rem 2rem;
  }

  /* Deco rule: a brass hairline with a stepped diamond, the style's signature. */
  .deco {
    height: 3px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--brass-dim) 12%, var(--brass) 50%, var(--brass-dim) 88%, transparent);
    position: relative;
  }
  .deco::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 50%;
    width: 11px;
    height: 11px;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(45deg);
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 2px solid var(--brass);
  }

  .cols {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.75rem;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 16rem), 1fr));
  }

  .cols h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    margin-bottom: 0.55rem;
  }

  .cols p {
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 40ch;
  }

  .base {
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    border-top: var(--rule-w) solid var(--rule);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
  }

  .muted {
    color: var(--ink-mute);
  }
</style>
